@startuml
title L2-049 - Diagnose failures and verify recovery
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

actor "Owner / release reviewer" as actor
box "Backend - Loupe Evaluation / Operations application" #D1FADF
participant "Documented release / restore runner" as page
participant "RecoveryState" as entity
end box
box "Backend - Loupe Infrastructure and controlled runtime" #FFF4E5
participant "Production stores / workload adapters" as client
end box
note over page : Browser measurements use the production frontend in a controlled harness
actor -> page : Start workflow / review
page -> entity : Start timed restore [L2-049]
entity -> client : Restore database/media/work; replay newer deletions
client --> entity : Compatible dependencies and replay completion
alt required dependency/replay unavailable
entity --> page : Not ready; diagnostics preserve safe IDs
else all required checks pass
entity --> page : Ready within 4 h; <= 1 h pre-incident loss
end
page --> actor : verified recovery and redacted operational evidence
@enduml
